I sit in the kitchen.
I drink my morning coffee.
It is very hot today.
I look at my mobile phone.
There is a weather app on it.
I open that app.
How is the weather today?
The app shows it is very sunny today.
The temperature today is also high.
But the evening forecast is different.
It says there, it will rain in the evening.
It will rain today?
I am surprised.
Right now, there is only sunshine outside.
There are no clouds in the sky.
Will it really rain this evening?
This will be my first rain in Mumbai.
I happily drink my coffee.
